canonical_face_model.obj
========================

MediaPipe's canonical face model, copied unmodified from
https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe
  mediapipe/modules/face_geometry/data/canonical_face_model.obj

Copyright The MediaPipe Authors. Licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0; a copy is in LICENSE-mediapipe alongside this file.

The simulator uses it as the operator's face surface. Its 468 vertices are
the FaceMesh landmarks, which is what lets every simulated frame carry exact
ground-truth landmark positions.
